-schedule)` is the sole constructor path for
+The public `CompileStructuredStrict(program, request, schedule)` C++ API and
+`compile_structured_strict(...)` Python API return one immutable
+`StructuredCompileResult` containing the final `build_spec` and `artifact`.
+Internally, `PrepareStructuredTensorIrCompilation(program, request, schedule)`
